// Verb semantics (2026-08-10): `deal >= 1 and <= 2 from X to Hand of all`
// prompts for the count ONCE, then fans out — each player receives that many
// from the top.
player P1, P2
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2)
location Hand on all
location Deck on table

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three, Four) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal >= 1 and <= 2 from Deck private to Hand of all
  end stage
}
